        "created_at": "2015-02-10T19:04:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oxygen Leak with enough cards in the trash deals damage to all targets (I don't think Rampage has enough damage to do it), Relic Spirit is in play and gets destroyed, it brings back the Ruins of Malediction, which then gets destroyed and brings back the Relic Spirit, which then get destoyed and brings back the&nbsp;<span>Ruins of Malediction, repeat ad infinitum.</span></p><p><span>Or is there another?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>EDIT: Damnit Ronway!</span></p>",
